    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HENTAI PHOEBE</strong> is an exciting puzzle game for adults that invites you into a mystical world of magic and temptation. The main character, the charming and seductive witch Phoebe, adores darkness, magic, and the art of seduction. Her spells can melt any heart, while the enigmatic puzzles will challenge your logic and attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489480/extras/bb70193802b3fc181261baacf4097bad.poster.avif?t=1755420288\" width=640 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489480/extras/bb70193802b3fc181261baacf4097bad.webm?t=1755420288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489480/extras/bb70193802b3fc181261baacf4097bad.mp4?t=1755420288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your difficulty level:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy</strong> \u2014 for those who want to enjoy the game without unnecessary challenges.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moderate</strong> \u2014 for fans of a balance between challenge and enjoyment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard</strong> \u2014 for true puzzle masters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30 levels;      <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30 achievements;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Difficulty levels;      <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxing and romantic music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is not just about solving puzzles; it's about diving into the sensual, profound, and slightly dark world of the protagonist, where magic, passion, and intrigue intertwine into one. <strong>HENTAI PHOEBE</strong> gives you the chance to become part of this story, helping Phoebe achieve her goals and uncover the secrets hidden in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel Phoebe's magic for yourself \u2014 it will be a journey you won't forget.</p>",
